        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a “Dramatic Catcher Simulator” where the protagonist, trapped inside an arcade, aims to escape by conquering various claw crane games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the protagonist to challenge a wide variety of claw crane games installed throughout the arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics based on actual machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple machines with differing arm shapes and ranges of motion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategies that change based on prize shape and center of gravity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic gameplay requiring precise timing and positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It packs all those familiar gameplay styles you've seen before, letting you enjoy it using the same strategies as real crane games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059300/extras/5d040aaba297554761c8fd11c5bbc456.poster.avif?t=1766761249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059300/extras/5d040aaba297554761c8fd11c5bbc456.webm?t=1766761249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059300/extras/5d040aaba297554761c8fd11c5bbc456.mp4?t=1766761249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Objective and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to escape the game center. Clearing the claw machines prepared for each stage advances the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-Driven Simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer cabinets of varying difficulty in sequence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stages feature ADV segments and cutscene sequences</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using expressions inspired by 1990s games, the story depicts the peculiar relationship between the protagonist, a girl, and a retro-style man, set against a dimly lit, oppressive society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Told with an American New Cinema-style narrative that leaves room for interpretation, it unfolds as a gloomy, troublesome drama where “even though it's someone else's story, you somehow feel it relates to you.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059300/extras/101d104609d5150aca9b4994e246b86b.poster.avif?t=1766761249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059300/extras/101d104609d5150aca9b4994e246b86b.webm?t=1766761249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059300/extras/101d104609d5150aca9b4994e246b86b.mp4?t=1766761249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title may be streamed or live-commented without restriction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming for monetization purposes is also permitted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to narrative requirements, certain segments contain dark or heavy themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend streaming with consideration for your audience.</p></li></ul>",
